  "description": "Awoostria is an annual Austrian furry convention held in Vienna. It grew out of a bowling night among friends in 2022, followed by fursuit walks in Donaupark and a first furmeet, after the organizers noticed a lack of furry events in Austria. The first full furry convention was held July 25 to 28, 2024, at the Arcotel Wimberger Hotel. Since then each year has had a set theme, shown through artwork and decorations at the venue, a theme-specific story and game, and a charity supported by donations from events such as art shows, auctions and the maid café. Attendance has grown from 722 in 2024 to 1,702 in 2026.",
